== Biography
I am currently a Ph.D. student at Department of Statistics and Applied Probability, National University of Singapore (NUS), under the supervision of [https://blog.nus.edu.sg/stahd/ Prof. Dongming Huang].
Previously, I received my Master degree in the Department of Statistics from [https://stat.uchicago.edu/ The  University of Chicago] in 2021 advised by [https://www.stat.uchicago.edu/~wbwu/ Prof. Wei-Biao Wu]. I received my B.S. in the Department of Statistics from [https://www.sta.cuhk.edu.hk/default.aspx The Chinese University of Hong Kong (CUHK)] in 2019. 

